flowchart LR
    front[Front camera driver] -->|side-by-side raw Image| frontcal[Front calibration]
    yaml[(Measured calibration YAML)] -. read once .-> frontcal
    yaml -. read once .-> depth
    frontcal -->|left and right rectified Image| ml[Object detection]
    frontcal -->|left and right rectified Image| hsv[Front color thresholding]
    ml -->|per-class StereoObservation| depth[Depth estimation and source selection]
    hsv -->|per-class StereoObservation| depth
    depth -->|per-class map ObjectPosition| objects[Object positions in map]
    depth -. uncertainty and selected-source feedback .-> ml
    depth -. uncertainty and selected-source feedback .-> hsv
    bottom[Bottom camera driver] --> bottomcal[Bottom color calibration]
    bottomyaml[(Measured bottom YAML)] -. read once .-> bottomcal
    bottomcal --> flow[Optical flow]
    bottomcal --> bottomhsv[Color thresholding: bottom camera]
    sensors[IMU and pressure depth] --> ekf[Localization: EKF and map]
    flow -->|metric motion with scale and covariance| ekf
    ekf --> pose[Robot localization in map]
    ekf -->|timestamped camera TF| depth
    ekf -->|pose plus known plane or altitude required| bottomhsv
    bottomhsv --> bottomobjects[Bottom object positions in map]
